=== Step 5: the model (GLM-5.3-Flash) ===
  Maya-S24: Maya-S24, Maya-S with Q4_K attention and shared experts: about 1.5 GB less that stays on the GPU, so 24 GB cards hold more experts (decode about 14% faster there, 11% on 32 GB), close to Maya-S in quality.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/peasantsmith/GLM-5.3-Flash-Maya-GGUF (folder Maya-S24/); the files' own license applies.
  The model is 94.7 GB in 3 files; 3 still to download, about 95 GB, into
